/E (Color Me Mine in Logan is one of those hidden gems that's perfect all summer long! When it's too hot to be outside, this is the best way to spend an afternoon with your kids. Paint, pottery, and good company, it doesn't get much better than that! I took my granddaughter here and she absolutely loved it! It's the kind of experience that slows you down in the best way and leaves you with something totally one of a kind. Go check them out this month and show them some love!)
